5. Concepts Covered

This assignment covers the following OOP concepts:

- Classes and objects
- Encapsulation
- Private attributes
- Constructors
- Default constructors
- Parameterized constructors
- Copy constructors
- Getters and setters
- "this" keyword
- Object references
- Method calls using the dot operator
- Method overloading through constructors
- Object-to-object operations
- "toString()"
- Arithmetic methods
- Helper methods
- Object independence
- Stack and heap visualization
- Basic validation and edge-case handling

